iscovery made  countless ads short films and worked  with incredible brands on multiple  youtube videos and we don't even have a  website but i'm actually thinking now  while saying this i'm going to create a  website before this video goes live so  you'll see it in the link below go check  it out if you'd like to join us be a  part of the team or hire us to make rad  meaningful [ __ ] for you or for your  brand as i said before i'll be keeping  you up to date on my youtube channel  monthly with what we're up to like  shooting my first ever feature film this  is just the beginning for us thank you  so much for watching and i hope that you  could have learned something from this  video other than that don't forget  you're awesome brew and it's sad to say  goodbye to the brew show for now but  i'll see you soon on my youtube channel  so  [Music]

